ted_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yuppi_TBTB2/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a0e9b983/uploads/origins/b2eff9ee-7c2c-4a7f-9c83-a5dbb87191c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3072878abd584dfa5955b9eab3957fe7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a0e9b983/uploads/origins/b2eff9ee-7c2c-4a7f-9c83-a5dbb87191c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3072878abd584dfa5955b9eab3957fe7, https://si.imgix.net/a0e9b983/uploads/origins/b2eff9ee-7c2c-4a7f-9c83-a5dbb87191c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f3d4ccea1a3daa3461aebcd78ccdfef 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a0e9b983/uploads/origins/b2eff9ee-7c2c-4a7f-9c83-a5dbb87191c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce05f4187ba38ab6e62d158dcea76ed3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！ヴォアが好きだと聞いています。\nというわけで、あなたのキャラのボアを描いてください！\nhttps://x.com/yuppien_nuko/status/1689894935796035584?t=Vok5XtnNsQe0vgtTNs_cqA&s=19 .\nもしよければ、たくさんの人（たぶん彼女の友達か、あなたの他のキャラクター）を食べた後の、とても大きなお腹の彼女が見たいです。\nお腹が大きければ大きいほどいい！\n残りのディテールや構図は、あなたが考えてください。\nこのアイデアでOKならいいんだけど。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yuppi_TBTB2/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/663223a4/uploads/origins/39ee1654-ea69-4c57-9aa0-10d425175ebd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25bcffdc5f8c078908a51d6a3dfde2aa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/663223a4/uploads/origins/39ee1654-ea69-4c57-9aa0-10d425175ebd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25bcffdc5f8c078908a51d6a3dfde2aa, https://si.imgix.net/663223a4/uploads/origins/39ee1654-ea69-4c57-9aa0-10d425175ebd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c787404b1f2bfbf3a2476c17eb480ded 2x, https://si.imgix.net/663223a4/uploads/origins/39ee1654-ea69-4c57-9aa0-10d425175ebd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&f